<slide>
  --font-heading: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif
  --heading-size: 64px
  --text-size: 26px
  --accent: #e07a5f
</slide>

## A different voice

`--font-heading`, `--heading-size` and `--text-size` change typography for one slide.

Serif headings and bigger body text, straight from the `<slide>` block.

<notes>
  Deck-wide defaults go in "vars" in deck.json.
</notes>
